WEBVTT

00:01:20.940 --> 00:01:22.010
How weak!

00:01:22.820 --> 00:01:26.250
This is the kingdom
of Judus, possessor of...

00:01:26.510 --> 00:01:27.940
...the greatest military
power of any nation?

00:01:28.490 --> 00:01:31.840
No match for us,
the Four Lords of Havoc!

00:01:31.870 --> 00:01:35.240
Now the first seal is ours.

00:01:36.130 --> 00:01:41.710
There are four seals which
imprison the God of Destruction.

00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:45.610
That leaves three more for us to
obtain before we can resurrect it.

00:01:48.850 --> 00:01:53.150
But our ambitions beyond
that are boundless.

00:01:53.430 --> 00:01:57.180
Exactly. Once we've resurrected
the God of Destruction...

00:01:57.550 --> 00:02:00.100
...we shall drive
on until the day...

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:03.250
...we build the eternally promised
Sorcerers Kingdom in this world!

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:15.570
Hilander72
Ripped by

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:27.830
Go forth, creatures born of chaos!

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:59.260
It's no use!
There's too many of them!

00:02:59.290 --> 00:03:01.380
Damn, demi-humans!

00:03:04.900 --> 00:03:07.860
Pathetic!
Pathetic! Pathetic!

00:03:07.880 --> 00:03:11.510
How do they expect to stop me,
the invincible sorcerer Kebidabu...

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:15.730
...with such miserable
excuses for soldiers?!

00:03:30.150 --> 00:03:31.190
<i>Great...</i>

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:35.160
<i>And our main</i>
<i>forces WOULD have to...</i>

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:37.790
<i>...be off guarding the king</i>
<i>while he's on a royal expedition.</i>

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:39.950
Yoko, I've got...

00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:45.160
Rushe, I told you to knock...

00:03:45.190 --> 00:03:47.020
...before coming into
a girl's room, didn't I?!

00:03:48.610 --> 00:03:50.300
I'm sorry, Yoko.

00:03:50.420 --> 00:03:52.320
As- As long
as you understand.

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:55.270
So, what do you want?

00:03:55.480 --> 00:03:58.180
I brought you your laundry!

00:03:58.650 --> 00:03:59.820
My laundry?

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:01.840
Here it is!

00:04:08.660 --> 00:04:10.250
What... What did I?

00:04:17.850 --> 00:04:18.800
For heaven's sake!

00:04:18.930 --> 00:04:21.890
Why was Yoko so mad?

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:24.770
I know!

00:04:49.570 --> 00:04:52.350
Stand your ground! If we lose
here, we lose everything!

00:04:52.370 --> 00:04:54.570
Show them your pride as knights!

00:05:01.660 --> 00:05:06.040
Rushe? Where could he be
at a time like this?!

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:12.430
Out there?!

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:19.550
Rushe...

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:21.330
Oh, Yoko.

00:05:21.730 --> 00:05:24.470
Don't "Oh, Yoko" me!
What are you doing?!

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:28.250
Don't worry. I'm washing ALL
your underpants this time...

00:05:28.280 --> 00:05:30.440
...not just that one pair!

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:34.900
A- All of them?!

00:05:35.360 --> 00:05:37.180
What are you doing that for?!

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:40.430
We've got enemy
forces breaking in!

00:05:40.460 --> 00:05:42.340
Do you want to die here?!

00:05:47.850 --> 00:05:50.520
You're really pathetic,
you know that?!

00:05:50.550 --> 00:05:54.720
Doesn't having me, a girl,
saying this to you get you mad?

00:05:54.810 --> 00:05:57.110
Doesn't it make
you feel ANYTHING?!

00:05:57.360 --> 00:06:00.100
But, I like you, Yoko.

00:06:04.930 --> 00:06:05.980
Oh, forget it.

00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:08.280
Come on, let's get
to the cathedral.

00:06:08.410 --> 00:06:09.160
Okay!

00:06:19.760 --> 00:06:24.040
This is just too much for
the defense forces to handle.

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:28.670
Great Priest, we've just
learned that Judus has fallen.

00:06:29.270 --> 00:06:33.080
I see... Even a country
as strong as Judus.

00:06:34.310 --> 00:06:40.300
So, the first seal is now in the
hands of the Four Lords of Havoc.

00:06:45.990 --> 00:06:49.440
The seals to the god of
ultimate evil, who burned...

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:52.920
...the old world to ashes
in seven days... Ansla-Sax!

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:58.720
This kingdom of Meta-Rikana,
one of the breakwaters against...

00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:03.710
...the God of Destruction's
rebirth, must not fall to them now!

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:09.710
But, to stand against a dark
sorcerer like Kebidabu...

00:07:12.180 --> 00:07:15.980
We've no choice but to use
our one ace in the hole!

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:21.450
Hurry!

00:07:21.820 --> 00:07:22.990
We're the last ones!

00:07:33.410 --> 00:07:34.850
I hope you aren't hurt...

00:07:36.380 --> 00:07:37.780
Tia Note Yoko

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:40.970
Princess Sheela!
You're okay, too!

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:47.520
The priests have created a ward of
protection around the altar area.

00:07:48.790 --> 00:07:53.340
We'll just have to hold out until
the expeditionary forces return.

00:07:53.880 --> 00:07:57.880
But it's just a matter of time
until the castle collapses!

00:07:57.970 --> 00:08:01.260
How long can the
ward withstand that?

00:08:01.390 --> 00:08:03.930
All we can do now is flee, so!

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:14.360
<i>Yoko, the time has come to</i>
<i>give you a secret spell.</i>

00:08:15.610 --> 00:08:19.180
This spell will allow you
to use the holy power...

00:08:19.210 --> 00:08:24.860
...to release the Ancient Wizard
sealed inside a certain person.

00:08:24.920 --> 00:08:28.340
But this is a very dangerous spell,
to be used only in an emergency.

00:08:28.590 --> 00:08:32.220
It mustn't be used unless the
kingdom faces ultimate peril.

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:39.300
And Yoko, in order for
this spell to be effective...

00:08:39.630 --> 00:08:41.110
...you must be a pure...

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:43.580
He's gotta be kidding!

00:08:44.560 --> 00:08:50.040
The priests may be right.
We shouldn't shed blood needlessly.

00:08:50.410 --> 00:08:51.160
Princess?

00:08:51.700 --> 00:08:54.210
We've no choice.
We'll have to flee.

00:08:54.650 --> 00:08:55.950
Princess Sheela.

00:09:06.410 --> 00:09:08.230
Great Priest Geo.

00:09:09.660 --> 00:09:10.620
Father...

00:09:10.960 --> 00:09:13.020
That's right! Surely Geo,
the hero of the...

00:09:13.050 --> 00:09:15.320
...great war 15 years
ago can do something!

00:09:15.540 --> 00:09:18.070
That's right! HE'S here!

00:09:19.460 --> 00:09:23.470
There is only one way
to save Meta-Rikana.

00:09:24.060 --> 00:09:25.660
There IS a way?

00:09:26.060 --> 00:09:26.610
Yes.

00:09:37.620 --> 00:09:40.840
Oh, no...
Father, you don't mean!

00:09:41.360 --> 00:09:44.760
The holy seal must be... broken!

00:09:46.280 --> 00:09:47.640
Oh, no!

00:09:48.340 --> 00:09:52.640
The only way to save Meta-Rikana
is to break the holy seal!

00:09:53.090 --> 00:09:54.670
Holy seal?

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:56.530
What's he talking about?

00:09:56.820 --> 00:10:00.840
Most cleric's spells only deal
with protection and healing.

00:10:01.290 --> 00:10:08.130
To fight dark sorcerers and monsters
you need a wizard's attack spell.

00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:11.880
We must perform the
seal breaking ceremony...

00:10:11.910 --> 00:10:14.340
...to release a legendary
wizard! It's now or never!

00:10:14.370 --> 00:10:18.820
You mean it?! Then now's the
time to release that power!

00:10:18.890 --> 00:10:19.870
- Miss Yoko!

00:10:19.870 --> 00:10:21.160
- Miss Yoko!
- Miss Yoko!

00:10:23.110 --> 00:10:24.240
I can't do it!

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:25.380
WHAT?!!

00:10:25.910 --> 00:10:28.810
Tia, I'm asking you as well.

00:10:29.110 --> 00:10:33.630
I don't know how
dangerous this ceremony is...

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:36.360
...but a lot of people
are dying as we speak!

00:10:45.340 --> 00:10:49.240
NO! I can't do something
as embarrassing as that!

00:10:49.860 --> 00:10:51.500
E- Em...

00:10:51.530 --> 00:10:53.180
Embarrassing?

00:10:56.520 --> 00:11:00.360
Yoko, to save Rushe...

00:11:00.390 --> 00:11:04.150
...you must release the
power sleeping within him!

00:11:04.800 --> 00:11:09.610
But, to do that, you can't
just cast an ordinary spell.

00:11:10.880 --> 00:11:17.500
It requires the power of...
Of a pure virgin's first kiss!

00:11:17.530 --> 00:11:22.560
I can't! And what about me?!
What about my purity?!

00:11:22.920 --> 00:11:26.730
Your purity gives
the spell its power.

00:11:27.010 --> 00:11:29.130
No way! I absolutely refuse!

00:11:41.230 --> 00:11:44.940
Lord Kall-Su! We've a report from
the 7th army attacking Meta-Rikana.

00:11:45.530 --> 00:11:49.030
The sorcerer Kebidabu is a step
away from entering the castle!

00:11:49.660 --> 00:11:50.410
I see...

00:11:50.700 --> 00:11:53.580
Not bad for that fool.

00:11:54.240 --> 00:12:01.000
Even Kebidabu can conquer a magic
backwater kingdom like Meta-Rikana.

00:12:03.210 --> 00:12:07.940
Do you remember, Kall?
15 years ago?

00:12:09.510 --> 00:12:13.850
When we four and Dark Schneider
buried those kingdoms?

00:12:18.230 --> 00:12:20.060
That's ancient history.

00:12:20.270 --> 00:12:23.810
That man died that day,
15 years ago.

00:12:24.820 --> 00:12:26.610
Along with his
legendary invincibility.

00:12:47.210 --> 00:12:52.590
I am Von Jobina, captain of
the knights of Meta-Rikana!

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:56.390
Wha...?!

00:12:58.160 --> 00:13:00.900
Meta-Rikana is nothing to me!

00:13:00.930 --> 00:13:02.730
I'm not beaten yet!

00:13:02.890 --> 00:13:03.920
Oh, really?

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:13.220
Damn you... The pride...
The pride of a knight is!

00:13:22.580 --> 00:13:24.810
They're...
They're in the castle!

00:13:24.840 --> 00:13:26.240
Oh, we're doomed!

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:27.480
Princess Sheela!

00:13:27.510 --> 00:13:28.760
Hurry! Perform the ceremony!

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:31.690
I'm scared!

00:13:32.850 --> 00:13:33.750
Rushe...

00:13:36.740 --> 00:13:38.960
Don't worry.
It'll be all right.

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:48.810
<i>To save Rushe, you must release</i>
<i>the power sleeping within him!</i>

00:13:51.690 --> 00:13:52.800
What's wrong?

00:14:00.490 --> 00:14:02.260
Yoko, your face is all red...

00:14:04.080 --> 00:14:06.290
Be quiet! Just sit there.

00:14:14.490 --> 00:14:15.200
Accept...

00:14:18.470 --> 00:14:23.390
In the name of Ino Marta,
beloved goddess of beauty...

00:14:25.370 --> 00:14:27.810
...break now this seal.

00:14:51.470 --> 00:14:54.090
Yoko, don't tell me you?!

00:14:55.070 --> 00:14:57.130
No, you idiot! Don't start
ruining my reputation!

00:14:58.050 --> 00:14:59.640
I am an honest to
goodness, totally pure...

00:15:04.430 --> 00:15:06.980
Anyway, I followed your
instructions to the letter, so...

00:15:14.280 --> 00:15:15.240
Rushe...

00:15:27.870 --> 00:15:29.500
What's this evil power?!

00:15:46.030 --> 00:15:50.640
I AM REBORN!!!

00:15:58.280 --> 00:16:01.620
At last!
At last, I am reborn!

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:09.210
What's... What's this
strange power I sense?!

00:16:13.790 --> 00:16:16.920
Are...
Are you really Rushe?

00:16:18.010 --> 00:16:22.470
While I am the transformed
ancient wizard Dark Schneider...

00:16:22.890 --> 00:16:24.890
...I am also your friend Rushe.

00:16:27.310 --> 00:16:28.730
Come, can you stand?

00:16:32.690 --> 00:16:34.860
<i>He's totally different.</i>

00:16:35.360 --> 00:16:39.570
You mean Dark Schneider has been
in that little boy all this time?!

00:16:39.690 --> 00:16:42.910
That's what you meant by
a resurrection ceremony?

00:16:44.280 --> 00:16:49.290
<i>That's Dark Schneider...</i>
<i>Brother's enemy...</i>

00:16:50.370 --> 00:16:52.210
So, you're alive again!

00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:59.100
We're in great danger!
We'll give you anything you want!

00:16:59.130 --> 00:17:03.250
Quickly! Use your magic
to smash our enemies! Go!

00:17:03.850 --> 00:17:05.660
Hmpf! I think not.

00:17:06.070 --> 00:17:07.940
Wha- WHAT?!!

00:17:08.010 --> 00:17:11.490
You accursed!
What do you want?!

00:17:11.520 --> 00:17:13.990
We said we'd give you anything!

00:17:14.020 --> 00:17:17.910
Listen, you old farts.
What I want...

00:17:19.190 --> 00:17:21.530
...is to rule the entire world!

00:17:23.690 --> 00:17:27.930
Along with your head
on a platter, Great Priest!

00:17:29.860 --> 00:17:32.130
One of the five people who...

00:17:32.160 --> 00:17:35.700
...defeated me 15 years ago
before I could conquer the world.

00:17:36.270 --> 00:17:40.800
The cleric who transformed and
imprisoned me with his spell.

00:17:42.070 --> 00:17:43.700
At last we meet...

00:17:45.550 --> 00:17:49.640
And now to pay you back
for what you've done!

00:17:50.480 --> 00:17:53.210
Why?! Why this man?!

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:56.040
What... What's going on?!

00:17:57.650 --> 00:18:01.090
Let's go, Geo!

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:05.180
Wait! Rushe, wait!
Half of you is Rushe, right?!

00:18:05.450 --> 00:18:07.410
Rushe would never do this!

00:18:07.720 --> 00:18:12.420
The great priest is my enemy!
He must not be allowed to live!

00:18:12.790 --> 00:18:17.610
Slaughtering your father is the first
step to my conquest of the world!

00:18:20.960 --> 00:18:24.760
<i>No...</i>
<i>That's not the Rushe I know!</i>

00:18:31.930 --> 00:18:37.230
Slayerd, Slayerd,
dark thunder of Balmor!

00:18:44.070 --> 00:18:48.810
What incredible power for it
to spook Hidora this much!

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:51.790
DIE, OLD MAN!!!

00:18:53.300 --> 00:18:57.040
<i>I... I have to</i>
<i>stop him! I have to!</i>

00:19:00.480 --> 00:19:02.590
<i>But... But...</i>

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:05.460
<i>I'm too scared to move!</i>

00:19:06.190 --> 00:19:11.220
Ele-Ele-Namu-Meilin! Holy spirit,
become our shield and protect us!

00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:13.320
BAL VOLT!

00:19:14.560 --> 00:19:15.990
STRIVER!!

00:19:27.800 --> 00:19:28.610
Father!

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:33.150
The ultimate magical defense...

00:19:34.570 --> 00:19:36.250
Well, how about this?!

00:19:39.060 --> 00:19:42.720
Zazard, zazard, scrono...

00:19:42.720 --> 00:19:42.880
Uh-oh!
Zazard, zazard, scrono...

00:19:42.880 --> 00:19:43.420
Uh-oh!

00:19:46.560 --> 00:19:50.010
Burning in the depths
of darkness, fires of...

00:19:55.810 --> 00:19:56.580
Tia!

00:19:57.320 --> 00:19:59.710
Kebi-bi-bi-dabu!

00:20:01.980 --> 00:20:04.790
I am the great Kebidabu,
talented disciple...

00:20:04.820 --> 00:20:07.940
...of the great
sorcerer Kall-Su...

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:10.210
...who shall soon
be master of the world!

00:20:14.170 --> 00:20:18.220
You?! You're the source of
the evil power I sensed before!

00:20:18.380 --> 00:20:20.690
I see you're quite skilled.

00:20:21.630 --> 00:20:24.910
You, a humble wizard,
shall have the honor of...

00:20:24.940 --> 00:20:28.890
...dying at the hands
of the great Kebidabu!

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:32.400
Tia! Tia! Tia!

00:20:35.280 --> 00:20:39.040
That hurt,
you widow-peaked freak!

00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:41.120
Widow-peaked!

00:20:41.990 --> 00:20:45.090
Look! You've drawn blood!

00:20:45.410 --> 00:20:49.030
Come on down here
now so I can kill you!

00:20:49.950 --> 00:20:52.970
You puff-gilled fishman!

00:20:55.340 --> 00:21:00.630
YOU... - !
You impudent!!!

00:21:00.760 --> 00:21:03.830
Kill him! Kill him
a million times over!

00:21:04.280 --> 00:21:06.280
HIDORA!

00:21:13.440 --> 00:21:15.330
You should
know when to shut up!

00:21:15.360 --> 00:21:18.360
All right, now for
the coup de grace!

00:21:18.390 --> 00:21:22.040
Now, go on! Go on
and devour his body!

00:21:37.090 --> 00:21:38.890
My Hidora!

00:21:39.350 --> 00:21:44.430
Okay, Widow's-Peak. You've
really gone and pissed me off!

00:21:45.170 --> 00:21:49.400
First, you interrupted me while I was
trying to slaughter the great priest.

00:21:49.690 --> 00:21:54.290
Second... You cut my face.

00:21:55.500 --> 00:22:00.160
Third... You threatened Yoko.

00:22:01.510 --> 00:22:03.600
And for that... YOU DIE!

00:22:04.400 --> 00:22:08.850
Zazard, zazard,
scrono-rono-sook...

00:22:08.880 --> 00:22:12.440
That... That spell... Stop!

00:22:13.000 --> 00:22:18.370
Burning in the depths
of darkness, fires of hell!

00:22:20.690 --> 00:22:21.810
Help me!

00:22:23.250 --> 00:22:27.290
Become my sword and
strike down my enemy! VENOM!

00:22:57.490 --> 00:23:00.240
Cannon fodder... DAMNED!

00:23:06.500 --> 00:23:08.770
And now it's your turn.

00:23:08.930 --> 00:23:11.190
I told you we shouldn't
have revived him!

00:23:15.420 --> 00:23:17.240
Ru- Rushe!

00:23:17.740 --> 00:23:21.290
Stop it, please!

00:23:22.320 --> 00:23:24.820
Rushe wouldn't do this!

00:23:27.460 --> 00:23:32.340
You really aren't Rushe!
My Rushe would never, ever do this!

00:23:32.520 --> 00:23:35.030
You're really
just some evil wizard!

00:23:37.980 --> 00:23:41.640
Give him back...
Give me my Rushe back!

00:23:42.200 --> 00:23:42.870
Tia...

00:23:44.350 --> 00:23:48.710
Y- Yoko... I AM Rushe.

00:23:49.540 --> 00:23:51.390
We both share the same soul...

00:23:51.910 --> 00:23:54.630
...even though we have different
appearances and personalities.

00:23:55.810 --> 00:23:58.010
If Rushe dies, then I die.

00:23:59.520 --> 00:24:01.200
Whatever Rushe loves...

00:24:02.230 --> 00:24:03.850
...I love as well.

00:24:15.160 --> 00:24:15.840
What's?!

00:24:23.880 --> 00:24:28.280
Oh, the spell to seal him
back is also a virgin's kiss.

00:24:29.210 --> 00:24:30.530
RUSHE!

00:24:31.280 --> 00:24:33.420
You even smell like
sunshine like you always do!

00:24:35.090 --> 00:24:37.440
What's wrong, Yoko?

00:24:38.110 --> 00:24:41.950
The explosive wizard,
Dark Schneider...

00:24:44.760 --> 00:24:48.580
...is most definitely
the ancient wizard.

00:24:57.490 --> 00:25:02.070
Yoko, your clothes are all
dirty. I'll wash them for you!

00:25:03.820 --> 00:25:07.360
Rushe, do you like me?

00:25:07.460 --> 00:25:08.470
I do!

00:25:17.260 --> 00:25:21.720
<i>The only spell that could release</i>
<i>such dark power is Venom.</i>

00:25:22.910 --> 00:25:26.160
<i>But Venom was destroyed</i>
<i>along with Dark Schneider.</i>

00:25:28.130 --> 00:25:31.030
<i>Could it be?! Have you</i>
<i>somehow come back to life?</i>

00:25:34.160 --> 00:25:36.360
<i>Guess I'll find out for</i>
<i>sure in the next episode.</i>
